{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Torsion.skein_generation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Torsion.skein_generation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Algebra.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.RingTheory.Adjoin.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Set.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Finset.Basic"],"declarations":23,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.trivialHadronSkeinResolution","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.trivialHadronSkeinResolution","kind":"def","line":256,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/skein_generation.lean#L256-L270","doc":"Non-vacuity for the hadron-relative interface. A `def`, not an `instance`,\nfor the reason given above. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.skein_generation_hadron","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.skein_generation_hadron","kind":"theorem","line":240,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/skein_generation.lean#L240-L254","doc":"**Skein generation, hadron-restricted** — the narrative's own statement.\n\n*Every hadron admits a terminal Skein resolution into a finite polynomial\nin the fundamental knots and the Hopf link.*\n\nDerived from a hadron-relative terminating resolution, not assumed. The\n`Finset` in `resolve` is the \"finite polynomial\"; the strict decrease is\nthe \"terminal\". ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.hadron_mem_adjoin_of_complexity_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.hadron_mem_adjoin_of_complexity_eq","kind":"theorem","line":222,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/skein_generation.lean#L222-L238","doc":"The hadron-restricted induction. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.HadronSkeinResolution.resolve","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.HadronSkeinResolution.resolve","kind":"theorem","line":218,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/skein_generation.lean#L218-L218","doc":"Resolution step, required only of hadrons and **producing** hadrons —\nwithout that the induction could leave the restricted class. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.HadronSkeinResolution.base","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.HadronSkeinResolution.base","kind":"theorem","line":214,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/skein_generation.lean#L214-L214","doc":"Base case, required only of hadrons. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.HadronSkeinResolution.complexity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.HadronSkeinResolution.complexity","kind":"def","line":212,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/skein_generation.lean#L212-L212","doc":"Complexity measure; crossing number in the intended model. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.HadronSkeinResolution.Hadron","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.HadronSkeinResolution.Hadron","kind":"def","line":210,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/skein_generation.lean#L210-L210","doc":"The hadron predicate — the narrative's quantifier. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.HadronSkeinResolution.hopfLink","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.HadronSkeinResolution.hopfLink","kind":"def","line":208,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/skein_generation.lean#L208-L208","doc":"The Hopf-link generator `𝓛_Hopf`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.HadronSkeinResolution.fundamentalKnot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.HadronSkeinResolution.fundamentalKnot","kind":"def","line":206,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/skein_generation.lean#L206-L206","doc":"The fundamental knot embeddings `K_i ∈ 𝓢_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.HadronSkeinResolution.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.HadronSkeinResolution.mk","kind":"ctor","line":203,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/skein_generation.lean#L203-L203","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.HadronSkeinResolution","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.HadronSkeinResolution","kind":"class","line":198,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/skein_generation.lean#L198-L220","doc":"Hadron-relative terminating resolution.\n\nWeaker than `SkeinGenerationContext`: `base` and `resolve` are required\nonly of hadrons, and `resolve` must produce hadrons, so the induction stays\ninside the restricted class. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.trivialSkeinGenerationContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.trivialSkeinGenerationContext","kind":"def","line":162,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/skein_generation.lean#L162-L179","doc":"A trivial context: every element is its own fundamental knot, so the\ngenerating set is everything and all complexities are `0`.\n\nTrivial as a *resolution* — `resolve` is never reached — but it establishes\nthat the four fields are jointly satisfiable, which is what non-vacuity\nrequires. It says nothing about the intended Skein-module model. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.skein_generation_top","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.skein_generation_top","kind":"theorem","line":139,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/skein_generation.lean#L139-L148","doc":"The generation statement in `= ⊤` form — the shape the previous encoding\ntook as a hypothesis. It is now a **consequence**. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.skein_generation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.skein_generation","kind":"theorem","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/skein_generation.lean#L122-L137","doc":"**Skein-module generation** ([`prop:skein-generation`]).\n\nEvery Skein element lies in the subalgebra generated by the fundamental\ntorus knots and the Hopf link.\n\n**Derived, not assumed.** The proof is the strong induction above; the\ncontext supplies a terminating resolution, and the conclusion follows from\nit. A context whose `resolve` did not strictly decrease `complexity` would\nnot yield this. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:skein-generation","label":"prop:skein-generation","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/skein-generation.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.mem_adjoin_of_complexity_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.mem_adjoin_of_complexity_eq","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/skein_generation.lean#L103-L120","doc":"**Every element of bounded complexity is generated.** The induction that\ndoes the work: strong recursion on the complexity measure. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.skeinGenerators","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.skeinGenerators","kind":"def","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/skein_generation.lean#L97-L101","doc":"The generating set: fundamental knots together with the Hopf link. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.SkeinGenerationContext.resolve","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.SkeinGenerationContext.resolve","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/skein_generation.lean#L93-L93","doc":"**Resolution step.** An element of positive complexity is expressible\nusing the generators together with *finitely many* strictly simpler\nelements — one application of the skein relations.\n\nThe `Finset` carries the narrative's \"finite polynomial\"; the strict\ndecrease is what makes the induction terminate. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.SkeinGenerationContext.base","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.SkeinGenerationContext.base","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/skein_generation.lean#L85-L85","doc":"**Base case.** An element of complexity `0` is irreducible: it already\nlies in the subalgebra generated by the fundamentals and the Hopf link. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.SkeinGenerationContext.complexity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.SkeinGenerationContext.complexity","kind":"def","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/skein_generation.lean#L82-L82","doc":"Complexity of a Skein element — crossing number, in the intended model.\nWell-foundedness of `ℕ` is what makes the resolution terminate. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.SkeinGenerationContext.hopfLink","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.SkeinGenerationContext.hopfLink","kind":"def","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/skein_generation.lean#L79-L79","doc":"The Hopf-link generator `𝓛_Hopf`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.SkeinGenerationContext.fundamentalKnot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.SkeinGenerationContext.fundamentalKnot","kind":"def","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/skein_generation.lean#L77-L77","doc":"The fundamental knot embeddings `K_i ∈ 𝓢_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.SkeinGenerationContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.SkeinGenerationContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/skein_generation.lean#L74-L74","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.SkeinGenerationContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.SkeinGenerationContext","kind":"class","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/skein_generation.lean#L69-L95","doc":"Abstract context for the Skein-module generation claim.\n\nThe fields are the **inputs** to generation, not generation itself: a\ncomplexity measure, a base case, and a resolution step that strictly\ndecreases it. See the module docstring for why (bean `qou-skgn`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}